    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>Weight stable; no fatigue, fever, or night sweats</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No socket discharge, pain, or irritation from the artificial eye; no eye pain on the other side</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No ear pain or discharge; no mouth sores</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations, or ankle swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Regular bowel habit; no bleeding or pain</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No dysuria, frequency, or leakage</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No falls, joint pain, or back pain</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No skin breaks on her hands or feet</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No numbness, tingling, or weakness in her hands or feet; no headache</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; PHQ-9 score 1 completed in braille</td></tr><tr><td>Endocrine</td><td>Negative</td><td>No polyuria, polydipsia, or heat or cold intolerance</td></tr><tr><td>Hematologic</td><td>Negative</td><td>No easy bruising or bleeding</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>13 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

