    <text><paragraph>Vital signs recorded on 1959-10-19; see the Vital Signs section. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Alert and well; BMI 22.4</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Artificial eye in place, clean, and well fitting; socket without discharge or inflammation; the other eye has no light perception and no redness</td></tr><tr><td>Ears</td><td>Canals and tympanic membranes normal</td></tr><tr><td>Neck</td><td>No thyroid enlargement or nodes; no carotid bruits</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Regular rhythm; no murmur; pedal pulses present</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Clear to auscultation bilaterally</td></tr><tr><td>Abdomen</td><td>Soft and non-tender</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Timed Up and Go 11.0 seconds with a cleared, described route; rises from a chair without using her arms</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Light touch, monofilament, vibration, and two-point discrimination normal in both hands and feet</td></tr><tr><td>Skin</td><td>Fingertips and palms without cracks or calluses that would blunt touch; no suspicious lesions</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Warm, engaged, and precise; judgment and insight intact</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

